+ * time while both cores were busy (TCG in tcg_cpus_exec 54% of the window, 183 MIPS against ~430 at
+ * 10 us); the old shared clock let one core run whole slices of up to a tick (1 ms) alone. */
+#define ICOUNT_CPU_QUANTUM_NS 10000.0
